  "description": "Preview, not production ready. SQLite adapter for AgentExperience.NET (story 28.7): one local database file for a single agent on one machine (a coding agent, a CLI, an MCP server). Implements the record store, the full-text candidate source (FTS5), the failure-signature source, the reuse-feedback ledger and the durable run store, and passes the same store conformance suite as the PostgreSQL adapter. Not provided: sharing grants, encryption and crypto-shredding, row-level security, vectors and retention sweeps. Requires Microsoft.Data.Sqlite 10.0.12 and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions 10.0.12 or later within the same major.",
